    return `<div class="sh-note ly-note" role="row"><div class="ly-nc" role="cell" aria-colspan="4">${stIcon('lay', 16)}<span><b>A managed layer of ${T} is on top</b>, so this component works as that solution sets it. ${T} was installed after ${S}, and importing ${S} again doesn't move its layer up.${MERGED[sheet.f.code] ? ` ${MERGED[sheet.f.code]} merges its layers, so the parts the solution on top doesn't change still come from the layers underneath.` : ''}<br>For the component to work as ${S} sets it, remove the component from ${T} (or change it there) and import that solution again as an upgrade, or uninstall it. If it isn't yours to change, make the change in a solution installed after it.</span></div></div>`
